On Fri, 08 Feb 2013 04:30:10 +0100, W.P. wrote:

> I am posting here since OpenWRT build system looks buildroot based.

OpenWRT forked from Buildroot many, many years ago, and has now very
significantly diverged. This means that people knowing Buildroot
generally don't know much about OpenWRT, unless they learned it
separately.

Therefore, any support request related to OpenWRT is not really useful
on this list, and should instead be directed towards the OpenWRT
mailing list or IRC channel.

Best regards,

